      },
      "text": "## Section 2: Static Pressure"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DUCTWORK.md#011",
      "path": [
        "07-DUCTWORK.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:hvac:07-ductwork, git-history:hvac:07-ductwork]",
        "canonical_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
        "concepts": "[ductwork]",
        "current_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
        "id": "maxim:hvac:ductwork",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "hvac",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[ductwork]",
        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ductwork",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The pressure the blower fan must overcome. Too much static = reduced airflow = reduced performance."
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DUCTWORK.md#012",
      "path": [
        "07-DUCTWORK.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:hvac:07-ductwork, git-history:hvac:07-ductwork]",
        "canonical_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
        "concepts": "[ductwork]",
        "current_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
        "id": "maxim:hvac:ductwork",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "hvac",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[ductwork]",
        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ductwork",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  PRESSURE DIAGRAM OF DUCT SYSTEM:\n                    |\n               [AIR HANDLER]\n               FAN (blower)\n                    |\n    (+) SUPPLY SIDE          (-) RETURN SIDE\n    ├── Supply plenum         ├── Return plenum\n    ├── Supply trunk          ├── Return trunk\n    ├── Branch supply ducts   └── Return grilles\n    └── Supply registers                │\n                                   [FILTER]\n                                   [COIL]"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DUCTWORK.md#013",
      "path": [
        "07-DUCTWORK.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:hvac:07-ductwork, git-history:hvac:07-ductwork]",
        "canonical_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
        "concepts": "[ductwork]",
        "current_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
        "id": "maxim:hvac:ductwork",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "hvac",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[ductwork]",
        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ductwork",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "TESP (Total External Static Pressure):\n  = pressure measured at supply + return plenums"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DUCTWORK.md#014",
      "path": [
        "07-DUCTWORK.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:hvac:07-ductwork, git-history:hvac:07-ductwork]",
        "canonical_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
        "concepts": "[ductwork]",
        "current_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
        "id": "maxim:hvac:ductwork",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "hvac",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[ductwork]",
        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ductwork",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Equipment rated at, e.g., 0.5\" w.c. at 1,200 CFM\n  Meaning: at 0.5 inches of water column back-pressure, blower\n  delivers 1,200 CFM (check blower curve for exact numbers)"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DUCTWORK.md#015",
      "path": [
        "07-DUCTWORK.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:hvac:07-ductwork, git-history:hvac:07-ductwork]",
        "canonical_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
        "concepts": "[ductwork]",
        "current_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
        "id": "maxim:hvac:ductwork",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "hvac",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[ductwork]",
        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ductwork",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "COMPONENTS OF PRESSURE DROP:\n  ┌────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ Filter (clean, MERV 8) │ 0.05–0.08\" w.c.                    │\n  │ Filter (MERV 13)       │ 0.10–0.15\" w.c.                    │\n  │ Filter (dirty)         │ 0.20–0.40\" w.c. (can double TESP!)│\n  │ AC evaporator coil     │ 0.10–0.20\" w.c.                    │\n  │ Supply duct system     │ 0.10–0.20\" w.c.                    │\n  │ Return duct system     │ 0.05–0.15\" w.c.                    │\n  ├────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ Typical total TESP     │ 0.35–0.70\" w.c.                   │\n  └────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DUCTWORK.md#016",
      "path": [
        "07-DUCTWORK.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:hvac:07-ductwork, git-history:hvac:07-ductwork]",
        "canonical_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
        "concepts": "[ductwork]",
        "current_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
        "id": "maxim:hvac:ductwork",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "hvac",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[ductwork]",
        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ductwork",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CONSEQUENCE OF HIGH STATIC PRESSURE:\n  - Reduced airflow → reduced sensible capacity\n  - Reduced airflow → potential evaporator coil freeze-up\n  - Reduced airflow → latent capacity loss (poor dehumidification)\n  - Fan motor works harder → higher electricity use + heat → shorter life\n```"
    },
