        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ductwork",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Straight duct has predictable pressure loss (friction). Fittings create turbulence —\nconverted to equivalent straight-duct length for calculation:"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DUCTWORK.md#020",
      "path": [
        "07-DUCTWORK.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:hvac:07-ductwork, git-history:hvac:07-ductwork]",
        "canonical_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
