        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ductwork",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  EQUIVALENT LENGTHS (approximate values):\n  ┌─────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ Fitting                     │ Equivalent Length (ft)            │\n  ├─────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────┤\n  │ 90° sharp elbow (square)    │ 50–75 ft                         │\n  │ 90° smooth radius elbow     │ 10–20 ft                         │\n  │ 45° elbow                   │ 5–10 ft                          │\n  │ Tee (branch takeoff)        │ 20–50 ft                         │\n  │ Transition (constriction)   │ 5–20 ft                          │\n  │ Supply boot (register box)  │ 25–50 ft                         │\n  │ Return grille               │ 15–30 ft                         │\n  └─────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DUCTWORK.md#021",
      "path": [
        "07-DUCTWORK.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:hvac:07-ductwork, git-history:hvac:07-ductwork]",
        "canonical_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
        "concepts": "[ductwork]",
        "current_path": "hvac/07-DUCTWORK.md",
        "id": "maxim:hvac:ductwork",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "hvac",
        "remap_from": "[]",
