        "root_concepts": "[ductwork]",
        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ductwork",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "A duct run with 3 sharp 90° elbows → adds 150–225 ft of equivalent length\n  On a 15-ft physical run, the fittings dominate the pressure drop"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DUCTWORK.md#022",
      "path": [
        "07-DUCTWORK.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:hvac:07-ductwork, git-history:hvac:07-ductwork]",
